LoGGP.py in this directory is third-party code. Its original header reads:

    # Copyright (c) by Alejandro Ordonez Conejo under BSD License
    # Last modified: Armin Lederer 02/2022

It implements the Locally Growing Gaussian Process of:

    A. Lederer, A. Ordonez Conejo, K. Maier, W. Xiao, J. Umlauft and S. Hirche,
    "Gaussian Process-Based Real-Time Learning for Safety Critical
    Applications", ICML 2021.

